#: crates/sam-gtk/src/perms.rs:853
msgid ""
"Protection on top of the sandbox: a filter that blocks dangerous system "
"calls, and Landlock, which lets the kernel itself stop writes outside the "
"granted folders. They cost nothing while an app works. Turn one off only "
"when an app's log shows it fails because of it, and only for that app; SAM's "
"repair steps say so when that is the case."
